      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The fire's dying light is the only truth left, and it's time to stop pretending you can fix what you've broken. Your hands are already stained with the blood of those who trusted you, so there is no point in trying to wash it off or pretend you're still a leader. The sun will never rise again, because the world has already turned to ash beneath your feet.",
